            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Jɔ-cua guk ruac ku la̱th piny kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ kä Cɛ-kɛm, kä cuɛ kɛ moc lueek kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱t ti bi kɛn kɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jɔ-cua ruaacni ti̱ti̱ gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk lueekni Kuɔth. Kä cuɛ päm mi dho̱k ka̱n kä cuɛ jɛ cuŋ thaar jiaath in la gua̱a̱th ri̱kä Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ naath diaal jiök i̱, “Jɛn päm ɛmɛ bɛ la ne̱e̱n kamädan kɛ Kuoth, kɛ ɣöö cɛ rieet diaal tin ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ kuen kɔn liŋ, kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ jɛn bɛ la ne̱e̱n mi bi yɛ gaŋ kä lucdun kɛ rɔ̱ Kuoth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cuɛ naath diaal ku jak kä wä, kä cu ram ɔ loc kui̱cdɛ rɛy rööl in ca däk kä kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Jɔ-cua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
